  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 69456d03988ca4e88921b432c824af2b, type: 3}
  m_Name: GameStartDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue_SO
  _lines:
  - Much cheaper than anything else in the city.
  - The landlord said the previous tenant had moved out in a hurry.
  - Most of their belongings were still inside.
  - I didn't ask any questions.
  - I needed a place to stay.
  - Besides...
  - What could possibly be wrong with an empty apartment?
  - The apartment was smaller than I expected.
  - Dust covered most of the furniture, and the air smelled stale, as if no one had
    lived here for a very long time.
  - While unpacking my things, I noticed there is a notebook on the desk.
  - There was no name on it.
  - 'Just one word scratched across the front. '
  - Diary. Press [TAB] to read.
  _playerReplyOptions: []
